-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Icons. spell_template HAS a spellIconId column, so keep it in step with the
-- client DBC even though the CLIENT is what actually renders the icon - a
-- disagreement here would be invisible until something server-side reads it.
--
-- Every Blacksmithing craft spell in this database, the real ones included, uses
-- icon 140 (Spell_Shadow_SealOfKings) - a shadowy face. Cloning inherited it.
-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
